WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.337
Quench is a fictional drinks shop that doubles as an encyclopedia of what the world drinks.

2
00:00:03.337 --> 00:00:08.632
You travel by map and step into a drink.

3
00:00:08.632 --> 00:00:15.704
Each drink page tells its story, with its sources.

4
00:00:15.704 --> 00:00:20.198
“Take it apart” turns the drink into ingredients you can buy.

5
00:00:20.198 --> 00:00:27.298
Markets are stalls on a map; every visit is stamped in a passport.

6
00:00:27.298 --> 00:00:34.483
A zero-proof switch removes alcohol from every page.
